{"title": "Sovereign's Protection (Condition)", "pageid": 22492, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sovereign's_Protection_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sovereign's Protection Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Sovereign%27s_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Sovereign's Protection</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Protected from the myconids' mushroom traps by the Sovereign's spore sac.</li>\n<li>Mushroom traps like <a href=\"/wiki/Bibberbang\" title=\"Bibberbang\">Bibberbang</a> are temporarily disabled for the affected creature, enabling safe passage. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_SOVEREIGNKEY</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CUND_SOVEREIGNKEY%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CUND_SOVEREIGNKEY%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ForceOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/ForceOverhead\">ForceOverhead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>While this effect works in most locations in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>, it does not function in <a href=\"/wiki/Camp\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Camp\">camp</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Sovereign.27s_Protection\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Sovereign's_Protection\">Sources of Sovereign's Protection</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Sovereign%27s_Key\" title=\"The Sovereign's Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/The_Sovereign%27s_Key_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Sovereign%27s_Key_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/The_Sovereign%27s_Key_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Sovereign%27s_Key_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/The_Sovereign%27s_Key_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Sovereign%27s_Key_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/The_Sovereign%27s_Key_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Sovereign%27s_Key_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/The_Sovereign%27s_Key_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Sovereign%27s_Key\" title=\"The Sovereign's Key\">The Sovereign's Key</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214203\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1405/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20155/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6009/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion d